{
  _id:        ObjectId
  text:       String        ← chunk content
  embedding:  Array[768]    ← Gemini embedding
  source:     String        ← "first_aid.pdf"
  category:   String        ← "medical/food/shelter"
  chunk_id:   Int
}

Index: Atlas Vector Search
  field: embedding
  dimensions: 768
  similarity: cosine

Pre-load before demo:
  → wilderness_first_aid.pdf
  → survival_guide.pdf
  → 100_emergency_recipes.json
  → snake_bite_protocol.txt     ← for demo


