LAYER 6 — MONGODB MCP INTEGRATION
───────────────────────────────────
MCP Server: @mongodb/mcp-atlas-server

Tool exposed: vector_search
  input:  { query_embedding, top_k: 3 }
  output: [ { text, source, score } ]

Called by: Google Cloud Agent Builder
  → Agent gets this tool automatically
  → No manual API call needed
  → Just configure MCP endpoint in Agent Builder


